(>> Solution to Question 1:) Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Explain the Anatomy of a Python Function. Detail function definitions \(def\), parameter declarations, docstrings, return semantics, and the LEGB variable scope lookup rule.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Theoretical Anatomy of Functions in Python:) Tj
T*
(   In Python, a function is a first-class citizen and an instance of the built-in function type.) Tj
T*
(   Anatomy:) Tj
T*
(   1. Header: Initiated with def, followed by function name, parameter list enclosed in) Tj
T*
(   parentheses \(\), and terminated by a colon \(:\).) Tj
T*
(   2. Docstring: An optional triple-quoted string immediately below the header describing) Tj
T*
(   functionality, parameters, and return types.) Tj
T*
(   3. Suite / Body: Indented block of statements executed when called.) Tj
T*
(   4. Return Statement: Explicit return expr passes values back to the caller and terminates the) Tj
T*
(   stack frame. If omitted, Python implicitly returns the singleton None.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. The LEGB Scope Resolution Rule:) Tj
T*
(   When an unqualified identifier is referenced inside a function, Python searches four concentric) Tj
T*
(   namespaces in strict hierarchical order:) Tj
T*
(   1. L \(Local\): Variables assigned within the function body or passed as parameters.) Tj
T*
(   2. E \(Enclosing\): Variables in outer functions of nested closures.) Tj
T*
(   3. G \(Global\): Module-level variables defined at the top level of the .py file.) Tj
T*
(   4. B \(Built-in\): Reserved built-in names preloaded into Python \(len, range, print, ValueError\).) Tj
T*
(   If the identifier is not found in any of the four tiers, Python raises a NameError.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Python Code Demonstration:) Tj
T*
(   # Global Scope variable) Tj
T*
(   GLOBAL_TAX_RATE = 0.18) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   def outer_accounting\(department: str\):) Tj
T*
(   # Enclosing Scope variable) Tj
T*
(   dept_code = department.upper\(\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   def calculate_invoice\(subtotal: float\) -> dict:) Tj
T*
(   """Compute net invoice with department overhead and tax.""") Tj
T*
(   # Local Scope variables) Tj
T*
(   tax_amount = subtotal * GLOBAL_TAX_RATE) Tj
T*
(   total = subtotal + tax_amount) Tj
T*
(   return {) Tj
T*
(   "Department": dept_code, # Enclosing \(E\)) Tj
T*
(   "Subtotal": subtotal, # Local \(L\)) Tj
T*
(   "TaxRate": GLOBAL_TAX_RATE, # Global \(G\)) Tj
T*
(   "Tax": tax_amount, # Local \(L\)) Tj
T*
(   "Total": total, # Local \(L\)) Tj
T*
(   "Type": type\(total\).__name__ # Built-in \(B\)) Tj
T*
(   }) Tj
T*
(   return calculate_invoice) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   invoice_fn = outer_accounting\("Research"\)) Tj
T*
(   print\("Invoice Computation Report:", invoice_fn\(1000.0\)\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. Complexity Analysis:) Tj
T*
(   - Local Variable Access: O\(1\) direct C-array offset lookup \(LOAD_FAST opcode\).) Tj
T*
ET

endstream
