BT
/F2 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(>> Solution to Question 2:) Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Analyze Function Arguments in Python: Positional, Keyword, Default, Variable-Length \(*args, **kwargs\), Keyword-Only \(*\), and Positional-Only \(/\).) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Python's Parameter Passing Taxonomy:) Tj
T*
(   Python provides the most versatile parameter specification system among mainstream programming) Tj
T*
(   languages:) Tj
T*
(   1. Positional Arguments: Matched to parameters by their position from left to right.) Tj
T*
(   2. Keyword Arguments: Matched to parameters by explicit parameter name \(func\(param=val\)\),) Tj
T*
(   allowing arguments to appear in any order.) Tj
T*
(   3. Default Parameter Values: Enables optional parameters with fallback values if omitted by) Tj
T*
(   caller.) Tj
T*
(   4. Variable-Length Positional \(*args\): Collects arbitrary excess positional arguments into a) Tj
T*
(   tuple.) Tj
T*
(   5. Variable-Length Keyword \(**kwargs\): Collects arbitrary excess keyword arguments into a) Tj
T*
(   dictionary.) Tj
T*
(   6. Keyword-Only Arguments \(PEP 3102\): Parameters following a bare asterisk * or *args that) Tj
T*
(   CANNOT be passed positionally.) Tj
T*
(   7. Positional-Only Arguments \(PEP 570, Python 3.8+\): Parameters preceding a slash / that CANNOT) Tj
T*
(   be passed as keyword arguments.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Complete Grammar Specification:) Tj
T*
(   def func\(pos_only1, pos_only2, /, pos_or_kw, *args, kw_only, **kwargs\):) Tj
T*
(   pass) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Python Code Demonstration:) Tj
T*
(   def enterprise_api_client\(endpoint: str, version: float, /, timeout=30, *headers,) Tj
T*
(   auth_token=None, **query_params\):) Tj
T*
(   """Demonstrate all parameter modes in a single robust signature.""") Tj
T*
(   print\(f"Endpoint: {endpoint} \(v{version}\) [Positional-Only]"\)) Tj
T*
(   print\(f"Timeout: {timeout}s [Pos-or-Kw]"\)) Tj
T*
(   print\(f"Headers: {headers} [Variable *args Tuple]"\)) Tj
T*
(   print\(f"Auth: {auth_token} [Keyword-Only]"\)) Tj
T*
(   print\(f"Params: {query_params} [Variable **kwargs Dict]"\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   # Valid Invocation) Tj
T*
(   enterprise_api_client\() Tj
T*
(   "/api/v2/users", 2.1, 45,) Tj
T*
(   "Accept: application/json", "X-Trace-ID: 9812",) Tj
T*
(   auth_token="Bearer_Sec123",) Tj
T*
(   role="admin", status="active") Tj
T*
(   \)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   # Demonstrating Syntax Restrictions) Tj
T*
(   try:) Tj
T*
(   # Attempting to pass endpoint \(positional-only\) as keyword raises TypeError) Tj
T*
(   enterprise_api_client\(endpoint="/api/v1", version=1.0\)) Tj
T*
(   except TypeError as ex:) Tj
T*
(   print\(f"Caught Expected TypeError: {ex}"\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. Complexity Analysis:) Tj
T*
ET

endstream
