(>> Solution to Question 3:) Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Explain the Mutable Default Argument Trap in Python. Detail why def f\(lst=[]\) causes state contamination across calls, and demonstrate the idiomatic None sentinel pattern.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. The Mechanism of the Mutable Default Trap:) Tj
T*
(   In Python, default parameter expressions are evaluated ONCE at function definition time \(when) Tj
T*
(   the module is loaded and compiled\), NOT each time the function is called!) Tj
T*
(   - When def f\(target=[]\) is defined, CPython evaluates [] and creates a single PyListObject on) Tj
T*
(   the heap, storing a reference to it in the function's __defaults__ tuple attribute.) Tj
T*
(   - If the function mutates this default list in place \(target.append\(x\)\), the alteration) Tj
T*
(   persists inside the __defaults__ tuple!) Tj
T*
(   - Subsequent invocations of f\(\) that rely on the default parameter receive the exact same) Tj
T*
(   mutated list instance, causing subtle bugs and state contamination across independent calls.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. The Idiomatic None Sentinel Pattern:) Tj
T*
(   To ensure each function call receives a fresh, independent container:) Tj
T*
(   1. Assign None as the default argument value in the signature: def f\(target=None\):) Tj
T*
(   2. Inside the function body, check if the argument is None, and instantiate a new container if) Tj
T*
(   so:) Tj
T*
(   if target is None: target = []) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Python Code Demonstration:) Tj
T*
(   # Problematic Antipattern) Tj
T*
(   def bad_accumulator\(item, log=[]\):) Tj
T*
(   log.append\(item\)) Tj
T*
(   return log) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   print\("--- Demonstrating State Contamination \(Bad Pattern\) ---"\)) Tj
T*
(   print\("Call 1:", bad_accumulator\("A"\)\)) Tj
T*
(   print\("Call 2:", bad_accumulator\("B"\)\)) Tj
T*
(   print\("Call 3:", bad_accumulator\("C"\)\)) Tj
T*
(   print\(f"Function's internal __defaults__: {bad_accumulator.__defaults__}"\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   # Idiomatic Sentinel Pattern) Tj
T*
(   def good_accumulator\(item, log=None\):) Tj
T*
(   if log is None:) Tj
T*
(   log = [] # Brand new list allocated for each call!) Tj
T*
(   log.append\(item\)) Tj
T*
(   return log) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   print\("\\n--- Demonstrating Clean Isolation \(Good Pattern\) ---"\)) Tj
T*
(   print\("Call 1:", good_accumulator\("A"\)\)) Tj
T*
(   print\("Call 2:", good_accumulator\("B"\)\)) Tj
T*
(   print\("Call 3:", good_accumulator\("C"\)\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. Complexity Analysis:) Tj
T*
(   - Time Complexity: O\(1\) comparison and allocation.) Tj
T*
(   - Space Complexity: O\(1\) auxiliary frame memory.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
ET

endstream
