/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Implement the Tower of Hanoi algorithm in Python using recursion. Explain the mathematical induction, move sequences, and O\(2^N\) complexity analysis.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Problem Context and Rules of the Tower of Hanoi:) Tj
T*
(   Three vertical pegs: Source \(A\), Auxiliary/Helper \(B\), Destination \(C\).) Tj
T*
(   N disks of distinct sizes start stacked in decreasing diameter on Source.) Tj
T*
(   Objective: Move all N disks from Source to Destination subject to rules:) Tj
T*
(   1. Only one disk can be moved at a time.) Tj
T*
(   2. A larger disk can never be placed on top of a smaller disk.) Tj
T*
(   3. Only the top disk of any peg can be removed.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Mathematical Recurrence & Inductive Strategy:) Tj
T*
(   To move N disks from Source \(A\) to Destination \(C\) using Auxiliary \(B\):) Tj
T*
(   Step 1: Recursively move \(N - 1\) disks from A to B \(using C as helper\).) Tj
T*
(   Step 2: Move the single largest disk N directly from A to C.) Tj
T*
(   Step 3: Recursively move \(N - 1\) disks from B to C \(using A as helper\).) Tj
T*
(   Recurrence Relation for moves M\(N\):) Tj
T*
(   M\(N\) = 2 * M\(N - 1\) + 1 with M\(1\) = 1.) Tj
T*
(   Closed-form solution: M\(N\) = 2^N - 1.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Python Implementation:) Tj
T*
(   def solve_tower_of_hanoi\(n: int, source: str, destination: str, auxiliary: str, move_log=None\):) Tj
T*
(   if move_log is None:) Tj
T*
(   move_log = []) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   # Base Case: 1 disk) Tj
T*
(   if n == 1:) Tj
T*
(   move_log.append\(f"Move Disk 1: [{source}] -> [{destination}]"\)) Tj
T*
(   return move_log) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   # Step 1: Move top n-1 disks from Source to Aux) Tj
T*
(   solve_tower_of_hanoi\(n - 1, source, auxiliary, destination, move_log\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   # Step 2: Move nth disk from Source to Dest) Tj
T*
(   move_log.append\(f"Move Disk {n}: [{source}] -> [{destination}]"\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   # Step 3: Move n-1 disks from Aux to Dest) Tj
T*
(   solve_tower_of_hanoi\(n - 1, auxiliary, destination, source, move_log\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   return move_log) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET

endstream
