T*
(   - Time Complexity: Recurrence T\(N\) = 2*T\(N/2\) + O\(N\) -> O\(N log2 N\) by Master Theorem.) Tj
T*
(   - Auxiliary Space Complexity: O\(N\) memory to create merged subarrays.) Tj
